[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678920480","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103251#issuecomment-2678920480","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103251","id":2678920480,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6frRUg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:59:19Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:00:16Z","body":"I think the problem is just that cross-compilation with Clang isn't supported out of the box. The build is done for the `x86_64` target, so it enables the use of x86_64 assembly, and fails, as our SCons setup on the other hand assumes `arm32` from the `arch` argument.\n\nThat's also why official Godot builds made with GCC compiled specifically for arm32 don't have this issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678920480/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678924712","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103251#issuecomment-2678924712","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103251","id":2678924712,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6frSWo","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:00:46Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:00:46Z","body":"This is strange, calls to this function is in the `ZSTD_ENABLE_ASM_X86_64_BMI2` ifdef and should be compiled on `arm32`. So something should be wrong with architecture detection.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678924712/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678939839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103251#issuecomment-2678939839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103251","id":2678939839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6frWC_","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:05:42Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:05:42Z","body":"Seems like `arch=` actually do not do anything to select compiler on Linux (or even set `-march=` flag for cross compilation), so it will only work if `CC`/`CXX` and other cross tools are set in the environment.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678939839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678943320","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103251#issuecomment-2678943320","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103251","id":2678943320,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6frW5Y","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:06:56Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:06:56Z","body":"Yeah #64366 addresses that but needs proper review to make sure the chosen architectures are the ones we actually target.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678943320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678950965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103251#issuecomment-2678950965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103251","id":2678950965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6frYw1","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:09:03Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:09:03Z","body":"> Yeah https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/64366 addresses that but needs proper review to make sure the chosen architectures are the ones we actually target.\n\nProbably only partially, usually default toolchain is not capable of cross compiling, and won't have any libraries to link. But it should at least produce error if wrong tools are used.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678950965/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678975300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103251#issuecomment-2678975300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103251","id":2678975300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fretE","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:17:44Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:20:09Z","body":"I removed this from the 4.4 priorities as it's not actually a regression, it's a pre-existing issue that was just made more obvious by #96303. Even before that PR, the builds created with `use_llvm=yes arch=arm32` would actually be x86_64 builds.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678975300/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4529295339","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103251#issuecomment-4529295339","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103251","id":4529295339,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDfeP6w","user":{"login":"novaplusplus","id":3247833,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDc4MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3247833?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus","html_url":"https://github.com/novaplusplus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-24T16:15:58Z","updated_at":"2026-05-24T16:15:58Z","body":"I'm running into this using GCC on an x86_64 -> arm64 cross-compile build. I am compiling it in an ubuntu 20.04 container via Toolbox under Bazzite.\n\nBuild script I am using:\n```\n#!/bin/bash\ncd godot/\n../BuildPy/bin/scons -j14 \\\n\tplatform=linuxbsd \\\n\ttarget=template_release \\\n\tarch=arm64 \\\n\tproduction=yes \\\n\tlto=none \\\n\taccesskit=no \\\n\toptimize=none \\\n\tmodule_text_server_adv_enabled=no \\\n\tmodule_text_server_fb_enabled=yes \\\n```\nTried various combos of settings but I assume it's more fundamental.\n\nOutput (after a full compile previously, just to get the relevent messages):\n```\nnova@toolbx:/var/home/nova/Projects/Godot/Engine$ ./Build32_Template_Linux_Tiny.sh \nscons: Reading SConscript files ...\nBuilding for platform \"linuxbsd\", architecture \"arm64\", target \"template_release\".\nscons: done reading SConscript files.\nscons: Building targets ...\n[ 70%] Linking Program bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.arm64 ...\n[ 98%] /usr/bin/ld: bin/obj/core/libcore.linuxbsd.template_release.arm64.a(huf_decompress.linuxbsd.template_release.arm64.o): in function `HUF_decompress4X1_usingDTable_internal':\nhuf_decompress.c:(.text+0xb8e9): undefined reference to `HUF_decompress4X1_usingDTable_internal_fast_asm_loop'\n/usr/bin/ld: bin/obj/core/libcore.linuxbsd.template_release.arm64.a(huf_decompress.linuxbsd.template_release.arm64.o): in function `HUF_decompress4X2_usingDTable_internal':\nhuf_decompress.c:(.text+0x1afcf): undefined reference to `HUF_decompress4X2_usingDTable_internal_fast_asm_loop'\ncollect2: error: ld returned 1 exit status\nscons: *** [bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.arm64] Error 1\nscons: building terminated because of errors.\nINFO: Time elapsed: 00:00:16.61\n```\n\nI noticed in the process it never actually prompted me for any different toolchain to be required, so it seems like it also will just be compiling for x86_64 in this case? I also do have clang installed so it's possible it's quietly switching over to that in the background for the arm build, unsure.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4529295339/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]